{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RogueStacks</strong> is a management game where you will need to combine cards to defend your castle against enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example: drag a Sword card onto a Villager card to equip your card on the Villager, increasing their attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/0d7d88cb17138fd2c788c1be08c2679b.poster.avif?t=1759496806\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/0d7d88cb17138fd2c788c1be08c2679b.webm?t=1759496806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/0d7d88cb17138fd2c788c1be08c2679b.mp4?t=1759496806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Sell Cards</strong></u> \ud83d\udcb0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also sell cards in exchange for money, which in turn can be used to buy Card Packs. The packs contain several cards that will help you expand your kingdom. Each pack is centered on a theme, such as Building, Nature, and Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each Day Cycle, new enemies will emerge from the horizon. Therefore, make sure your castle is well-defended, or it will be destroyed! \ud83d\udc80</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Details</strong></u> \ud83d\udcb0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf +40 Cards to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 +20 Ideas to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 6 different Card Packs to buy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 2 to 4 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Combat</strong></u> \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An automatic combat begins as soon as a Villager encounters an evil creature. Face skeletons, goblins, rats, and much more! Improve your villagers' combat skills by training them with buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/caa8f2c717f6212a1e20c834c9ab33a6.poster.avif?t=1759496806\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/caa8f2c717f6212a1e20c834c9ab33a6.webm?t=1759496806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/caa8f2c717f6212a1e20c834c9ab33a6.mp4?t=1759496806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Defend your castle</strong></u> \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your kingdom by creating buildings that automatically defend your castle from enemies, for example, the tower that attacks nearby enemies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2829830?t=1759496806","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2829830?t=1759496806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/1cf52fb5615bddffcb057f97df5f1baca1e9b3db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759496806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/1cf52fb5615bddffcb057f97df5f1baca1e9b3db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759496806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RogueStacks</strong> is a management game where you will need to combine cards to defend your castle against enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example: drag a Sword card onto a Villager card to equip your card on the Villager, increasing their attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/0d7d88cb17138fd2c788c1be08c2679b.poster.avif?t=1759496806\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/0d7d88cb17138fd2c788c1be08c2679b.webm?t=1759496806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829830/extras/0d7d88cb17138fd2c788c1be08c2679b.mp4?t=1759496806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Sell Cards</strong></u> \ud83d\udcb0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also sell cards in exchange for money, which in turn can be used to buy Card Packs. The packs contain several cards that will help you expand your kingdom. Each pack is centered on a theme, such as Building, Nature, and Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each Day Cycle, new enemies will emerge from the horizon. Therefore, make sure your castle is well-defended, or it will be destroyed! \ud83d\udc80</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Details</strong></u> \ud83d\udcb0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf +40 Cards to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 +20 Ideas to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 6 different Card Packs to buy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 2 to 4 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Combat</strong></u> \ud83d\udde1\ufe0